# Where the site is published: the absolute og:url and og:image in index.html (link previews need absolute URLs).
# The build itself is relative (vite.config.ts, base './'), so only these change for another host or a custom domain;
# a VITE_SITE_URL in the environment overrides this.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://tkjaer.github.io/how-the-internet-works/
